"✓ Index dependency validation prevents unsafe deletions\n".echo();
"✓ Data propagation handles schema changes correctly\n".echo();
"✓ Transaction safety ensures data integrity\n".echo();
"✓ Comprehensive field type and storage support\n".echo();
"✓ Universal behavior across all database types\n".echo();

